1
00:00:03,726 --> 00:00:05,070
As Uke punches

2
00:00:05,071 --> 00:00:07,237
slide in deeply and pivot behind him

3
00:00:07,238 --> 00:00:09,105
as you do so control his wrist

4
00:00:09,106 --> 00:00:11,699
turn again sharply turning his wrist over

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,413
cutting down towards the mat,

6
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:16,193
as you do so turn his body over

7
00:00:16,194 --> 00:00:17,705
control his elbow and his wrist

8
00:00:17,706 --> 00:00:20,605
kneeling down
put his shoulder between your knees,

9
00:00:20,906 --> 00:00:23,412
control his arm close against the body

10
00:00:24,713 --> 00:00:26,361
and pin.

